{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tree_spruce","model_identifier":"tree_spruce","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tree_spruce\n\nReference spruce: a dense dark cone right to the ground, about 8 m (284 u).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -60..60, y 0..295, z -60..60 units (3.38 x 8.30 x 3.38 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 35.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- trunk: 12 x 284 x 12 at the origin (the solid, blocking part)\n- canopy: see bounds; units walk under it\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rustle` | 5.0 | loop | canopy bones sway very slightly (trunk still) |\n| `hit` | 0.4 | once | canopy shivers after an axe strike |\n| `fall` | 2.5 | once | whole `tree` group tips over sideways onto +X about the trunk base edge, hits at 1.5 s, bounces once, settles by 2.1 s; canopy whips on impact |\n\n## Notes\n\n- `rustle` and `hit` move only the canopy groups; `fall` rotates the `tree` group (pivot on the trunk base edge on +X), so the trunk lies along +X after 1.5 s (it stops short of flat where the crown meets the ground). Swap to the `_stump` model (and spawn the `_log_pile`) once it has settled.\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"trunk","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[6.0,274.4444,6.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[6.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,0.5556,12.0,275.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,0.5556,12.0,275.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,0.5556,12.0,275.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,0.5556,12.0,275.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[250.0,699.0,262.0,711.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[250.0,699.0,262.0,711.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5f4c3dc7-e259-5fa4-901c-69acc7ec75fa"},{"name":"tier0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.0,14.0,-37.2],"to":[60.0,29.2929,37.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,14.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,120.0,667.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,153.2,683.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,120.0,667.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,153.2,683.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[378.0,275.8,498.0,350.2],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,363.8,120.0,438.2],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1e20cd20-5661-5c66-ac99-bd8bd65873b4"},{"name":"tier0x","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-37.2,14.0,-60.0],"to":[37.2,29.2929,60.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,14.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,153.2,683.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,120.0,667.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,153.2,683.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,120.0,667.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.8,0.0,87.2,120.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[88.8,0.0,163.2,120.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8d0c0b89-b29a-5ca8-9a49-d25f2de99b11"},{"name":"tier0c","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-42.0,29.2929,-42.0],"to":[42.0,44.5859,42.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,14.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[416.0,651.4141,500.0,666.707],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[416.0,651.4141,500.0,666.707],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[416.0,651.4141,500.0,666.707],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[416.0,651.4141,500.0,666.707],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[54.0,275.0,138.0,359.0],"text