lrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"3de798ec-2bba-5e4f-a7d0-20cc33fe2e58","time":2.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]},"bacd104b-65b4-5b85-b42c-a38181ced0ed":{"name":"canopy_2","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"bea73053-85ce-58d8-955f-686e48368580","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"377dc904-54ff-59ce-9efd-4448c8383b44","time":1.45,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":-4.0}],"uuid":"a8303419-8a70-5d7c-9eff-197dec5b2335","time":1.55,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":3.0}],"uuid":"8b0f4cda-e41e-57e3-a71a-5b002e1e05ed","time":1.75,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":-1.5}],"uuid":"efd72b31-a6b9-52a5-8ee8-048d9282e6e6","time":1.95,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"2b8d1c8a-ad46-5f8a-8ab3-70896cc87c35","time":2.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"34d26f10-086c-55d1-8704-2a4c3e3592ed","time":2.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# tree_spruce\n\nReference spruce: a dense dark cone right to the ground, about 8 m (284 u).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -60..60, y 0..295, z -60..60 units (3.38 x 8.30 x 3.38 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 35.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- trunk: 12 x 284 x 12 at the origin (the solid, blocking part)\n- canopy: see bounds; units walk under it\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rustle` | 5.0 | loop | canopy bones sway very slightly (trunk still) |\n| `hit` | 0.4 | once | canopy shivers after an axe strike |\n| `fall` | 2.5 | once | whole `tree` group tips over sideways onto +X about the trunk base edge, hits at 1.5 s, bounces once, settles by 2.1 s; canopy whips on impact |\n\n## Notes\n\n- `rustle` and `hit` move only the canopy groups; `fall` rotates the `tree` group (pivot on the trunk base edge on +X), so the trunk lies along +X after 1.5 s (it stops short of flat where the crown meets the ground). Swap to the `_stump` model (and spawn the `_log_pile`) once it has settled.\n"}